## Directory Structure

```text
project/
├── .claude/              # Claude Code 配置（rules, skills, agents, commands）
├── templates/            # 文件模板
├── skills/               # 技能产出
├── references/           # 参考文档
└── CLAUDE.md             # 项目行为规范
```

## Quick Start

```bash
# Clone and set up
git clone [repo-url]
cd [project-name]
npm install

# Create a new skill
/new-skill <name>

# Lint all markdown
npm run lint:md
```

## Available Commands

| Command | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `/new-skill <name>` | Create a skill from template |
| `/new-agent <name>` | Create an agent from template |
| `/new-rule <name>` | Create a rule file from template |
| `/review-skill <path>` | Review a SKILL.md file |
| `/review-rule <path>` | Review a rule file |

## Templates

| Template | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `SKILL.md.template` | Skill definition |
| `AGENT.md.template` | Agent definition |
| `CLAUDE.md.template` | Project instructions |
| `REFERENCE.md.template` | Reference documentation |
| `COMMAND.md.template` | Slash command definition |
| `OUTPUT-STYLE.md.template` | Output style definition |
| `RULE.md.template` | Rule definition |

## Rules

All `.md` output is governed by path-scoped rules in `.claude/rules/`:

| Rule File | Applies To |
| --- | --- |
| `skill-writing.md` | `skills/**/SKILL.md` |
| `agent-writing.md` | `.claude/agents/*.md` |
| `markdown-output.md` | All `*.md` files |
| `yaml-frontmatter.md` | All files with frontmatter |
| `reference-writing.md` | `references/**/*.md` |
| `claude-md-writing.md` | `**/CLAUDE.md`, `CLAUDE.local.md` |
| `rule-writing.md` | `.claude/rules/*.md` |

## Quality

```bash
npm run lint:md      # Check all Markdown
npm run lint:md:fix  # Auto-fix violations
```
